{"name": "Very Safe Dino Park \ud83e\udd96", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to the Very Safe Dino Park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/078fdb03d7f5cac50a4634145b4a8107.poster.avif?t=1783335787\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/078fdb03d7f5cac50a4634145b4a8107.webm?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/078fdb03d7f5cac50a4634145b4a8107.mp4?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build, manage, and barely survive your own prehistoric theme park in this chaotic 1 to 4 player co-op simulator. Feed dinosaurs, clean up \u201cincidents,\u201d keep the guests under control, and hold everything together with duct tape and poor decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing can go wrong but life finds a way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"53\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/395532f245fc5432496159dbac33b444.webp?t=1783335787\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/758cb1ab2478d7d18786bbbec9493424.poster.avif?t=1783335787\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/758cb1ab2478d7d18786bbbec9493424.webm?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/758cb1ab2478d7d18786bbbec9493424.mp4?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open the gates. Sell the tickets. Pretend everything is fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Behind the scenes?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dinosaurs are getting hungry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guests are getting annoying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Systems are definitely failing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the park running, or watch it spiral into a very expensive mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"53\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/a998e07249fea0de272bdb66a7188b33.webp?t=1783335787\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/90f81b8828202e4155960cad31b4052c.poster.avif?t=1783335787\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/90f81b8828202e4155960cad31b4052c.webm?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/90f81b8828202e4155960cad31b4052c.mp4?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your dinosaurs are incredible, majestic and constantly seconds away from ruining your life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into enclosures to feed and manage them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean up mountains of poop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep them calm before they break out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tranquilise anything with too many teeth and a bad attitude</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If they get hungry, they will hunt. You are not special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"53\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/eeb67fbfa093f5c3251a579aa9cbdb29.webp?t=1783335787\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/3bfc5021c6d877100b8ca71cb0d38601.poster.avif?t=1783335787\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/3bfc5021c6d877100b8ca71cb0d38601.webm?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/3bfc5021c6d877100b8ca71cb0d38601.mp4?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guests are the reason you\u2019re here and everything is under control!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell tickets and overpriced merch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep vending machines stocked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean up litter, spills, and suspicious limbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deal with troublemakers however you see fit</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can escort them out politely. Or speed up the food chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"53\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/5d4524d9c2aa1519f048f04919f3a903.webp?t=1783335787\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/30f9f9a7a1df9d59ebe2b39639e7ba5b.poster.avif?t=1783335787\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/30f9f9a7a1df9d59ebe2b39639e7ba5b.webm?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/30f9f9a7a1df9d59ebe2b39639e7ba5b.mp4?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And it will break. Constantly.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scrub bloodstains and mystery puddles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the park clean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn dino poop into biofuel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the power on at all costs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because when the power goes out\u2026 the fences do too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"53\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/56a274abde507e8ea94bb1ba9c05e550.webp?t=1783335787\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/90e3f0c27bdcb4386170767ccad405b1.poster.avif?t=1783335787\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/90e3f0c27bdcb4386170767ccad405b1.webm?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/90e3f0c27bdcb4386170767ccad405b1.mp4?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start small. Mess up fast. Expand anyway.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new dinosaurs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build enclosures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add facilities and decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate repetitive tasks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your park into a world-class attraction\u2026 or a cautionary tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"53\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/04f15b866843258eb704857539780636.webp?t=1783335787\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/e69cc41f274203d63c925ff0b8976f2d.poster.avif?t=1783335787\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/e69cc41f274203d63c925ff0b8976f2d.webm?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/e69cc41f274203d63c925ff0b8976f2d.mp4?t=1783335787\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work together like a well-oiled machine. Or don\u2019t.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 to 4 player chaotic co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate tasks\u2026 or ruin everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw poop at your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lock them in enclosures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tranquilise them for absolutely no reason</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dinosaurs are dangerous. Your friends are worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"53\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/extras/3df5ed2020fa8b86ccdcbf378a0bbc4a.webp?t=1783335787\" width=\"780\"/></span>If you love friendslop games, or any of these: Schedule I, Waterpark Simulator, RV There Yet? YAPYAP, Peak, REPO, Bird Game 3, Content Warning, Lethal Company, We Gotta Go, Roadside Research, MIMESIS, Escape The Backrooms, Chained Together, Cursed Companions, Fall Guys, Scam Line, Burgling Gnome, Lockdown Protocol, Gamble With Your Friends, Super Battle Golf, Pratfall Side Effects you'll love Very Safe Dino Park \ud83e\udd96 too!  </p> </div>", "short_desc": "A chaotic 1 to 4 player dinosaur park sim where feeding the dinos, cleaning the mess, and surviving the chaos are all part of the job.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311530/c0ffd4ad80e7810e7a07da1781e2cf57e9831fe5/header.jpg?t=1783335787", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Co-op", "Simulation", "Management", "Dark Comedy", "Multiplayer", "Crafting"], "developers": "Panic Stations", "publishers": "Panic Stations", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4311530", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/zkjnjRJh--M", "first_seen": 1782684000.0, "review_rank": 361}